            "SDS, product hazards, skin and eye protection, and hygiene reviewed",
            "Ventilation, vapor, mist, dust, odor, and occupied-air routes controlled",
            "Respirator selection, medical, fit, cartridge, and program route verified",
            "Flammable storage, ignition control, spray zone, and fire protection verified",
            "Ladder, lift, scaffold, overhead work, and falling-object zones controlled",
            "Surface-prep tools, guards, dust collection, and noise controlled",
            "Access, egress, warning signs, containment, and public separation maintained",
            "Spill response, waste, rags, solvents, and container closure controlled",
            "Temperature, humidity, cure, and reentry restrictions communicated"
